menu "NOTE4C framework"
config NOTE4C_ENABLE_DEEP_SLEEP
    bool "Enable idle deep sleep (requires hardware validation)"
    default n
    help
        Enter deep sleep after 120 seconds idle, with GPIO0/GPIO18 low wake.
        GPIO39 Up is not an RTC wake pin. Battery latch is held high.
        Keep disabled until wake, latch and battery operation are validated.
endmenu
